Subject: [PATCH] feat: Provide metadata and MPRIS compatiblity

---
 build/main.js     | 152 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------
 build/renderer.js | 123 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 234 insertions(+), 41 deletions(-)

